# =============================================================================
# NOTE: this file is NOT the one Docker uses.
# =============================================================================
# LearnCraft builds with the repository root as the build context
# (`docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .` or compose `context: ..`), and Docker
# reads `<context>/.dockerignore` — that is the repository-root `.dockerignore`.
# It keeps .secret_key, .env files and *.db out of the image.
#
# This copy is kept only for reference by anyone running a `docker/`-scoped
# build; the root file is authoritative.
# =============================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
.venv/
backend/.venv/
.env
.secret_key
backend/.secret_key
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.pytest_cache/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

